  "plan": "1) Check for ensurepip and apt availability to bootstrap package installation. 2) Check python version and available media-handling modules. This determines how I install yt-dlp. Once yt-dlp is available I can inspect the video's subtitles (which might directly contain the typed commands) — that could avoid downloading/processing huge media entirely.",
